in 2024 for other literary works. The initiative aims to preserve and digitise India's manuscript heritage for future generations.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/memory-of-the-world-rajatarangini-mahabharata-arthashastra-get-un-recognition/articleshow/135577576.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/memory-of-the-world-rajatarangini-mahabharata-arthashastra-get-un-recognition/articleshow/135577576.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-05T20:16:54+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135577714,imgsize-238356.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Student union representatives from 7 states join ABVP rally at Delhi University]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/student-union-representatives-from-7-states-join-abvp-rally-at-delhi-university/articleshow/135577629.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135577629.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/student-union-representatives-from-7-states-join-abvp-rally-at-delhi-university/articleshow/135577629.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/student-union-representatives-from-7-states-join-abvp-rally-at-delhi-university/articleshow/135577629.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-05T20:11:48+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135577662,imgsize-161290.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Cabinet approves Rs 14,500 crore VGF scheme for energy storage]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cabinet-approves-rs-14500-crore-vgf-scheme-for-energy-storage/articleshow/135576662.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style