desh after other candidates failed to qualify. The nominations of Rajkumar Lohani and Kante Sayanna were rejected for not meeting necessary requirements. Puri's election follows the resignation of Union minister of state L Murugan in mid-October. Hemant Khandelwal, among other officials, was present when Puri collected his election certificate.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/hardeep-singh-puri-elected-unopposed-to-rajya-sabha-from-madhya-pradesh/articleshow/135570898.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/hardeep-singh-puri-elected-unopposed-to-rajya-sabha-from-madhya-pradesh/articleshow/135570898.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-05T16:45:40+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135571026,imgsize-61898.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Rahul Gandhi gets relief as Allahabad HC rejects plea seeking FIR over remarks on Sikh community]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rahul-gandhi-gets-relief-as-allahabad-hc-rejects-plea-seeking-fir-over-remarks-on-sikh-community/articleshow/135569496.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135569496.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rahul-gandhi-gets-relief-as-allahabad-hc-rejects-plea-seeking-fir-over-remarks-on-sikh-community/articleshow/135569496.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rahul-gandhi-gets-relief-as-allahabad-hc-rejects-plea-seeking-fir-over-remarks-on-sikh-community/articleshow/135569496.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-05T16:34:36+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135570672,imgsize-41788.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘If death is my destiny’: Sheikh Hasina firm on returning to Bangladesh in December]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/if-death-is-my-destiny-sheikh-hasina-firm-on-returning-to-bangladesh-in-december/articleshow/135569022.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135569022.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Sheikh Hasina has confirmed her intention to return to Bangladesh, despite facing a death sentence. The former Prime Minister is aware of the risks associated with her return, including potential arrest or worse. Hasina's Awami League party has been banned, resulting in widespread political repression and violence against its members. She expressed concerns over the rising influence of extremist groups in the current political climate.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/if-death-is-my-destiny-sheikh-hasina-firm-on-returning-to-bangladesh-in-december/articleshow/135569022.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/if-death-is-my-destiny-sheikh-hasina-firm-on-returning-to-bangladesh-in-december/articleshow/135569022.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-05T15:56:07+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135569288,imgsize-108992.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Jantar Mantar violence: SC gives panel 1 month to file report, flags lack of complaints]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/jantar-mantar-violence-sc-gives-panel-1-month-to-file-report-flags-lack-of-complaints/articleshow/135567729.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135567729.cms"